<section class="ex-note" id="diagnosis">
<h2>7. Diagnosis &amp; Pathergy Test（診斷與針刺試驗）</h2>
<ul>
<li>診斷依 clinical signs；沒有 pathognomonic laboratory tests 或 histologic characteristics。現行 <strong>International Criteria</strong> 是各套標準中最準確者（Table 141-1）。<span class="ex-ref">p.2573</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Symptom（症狀）</th><th scope="col">Points（分數）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Ocular lesions (recurrent)</td><td><strong class="ex-n">2</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Oral aphthosis (recurrent)</td><td><strong class="ex-n">2</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Genital aphthosis (recurrent)</td><td><strong class="ex-n">2</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Skin lesions (recurrent)</td><td><strong class="ex-n">1</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>CNS</td><td><strong class="ex-n">1</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Vascular manifestations</td><td><strong class="ex-n">1</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td><mark data-q="107-40,112-41">Positive pathergy test（陽性針刺試驗）</mark></td><td><strong class="ex-n">1</strong></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 141-1，p.2573。表格註：score <strong class="ex-n">≥4</strong> indicates Adamantiades–Behçet disease（註腳原書印為 “BCD scoring”，照原文）；主要計分系統不要求 pathergy test，但若有做，陽性結果可額外加 <strong class="ex-n">1</strong> 分。</p>
<h3>Pathergy test</h3>
<ul>
<li><mark data-q="115-04">陽性反應於 <strong class="ex-n">48 hours</strong> 內出現 erythematous papule（<strong class="ex-n">&gt;2 mm</strong>）或 pustule，位置在針刺處，或 intracutaneous injection 0.1-mL isotonic saline 後；使用 <strong class="ex-n">20-gauge</strong> needle，注射部位不先消毒</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.2573</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="115-04">針刺一般以 <strong class="ex-n">45°</strong> 角、intracutaneous <strong class="ex-n">3 to 5 mm</strong>，部位在 volar forearm</mark>；<strong>Erythema without infiltration</strong> 視為陰性。<span class="ex-ref">p.2573</span></li>
<li>注射或外傷後誘發的 oral aphthae 與 genital ulcers，也可視為陽性 pathergy phenomenon（如眼底光凝後角膜區 chorioretinitis）；更廣義的 pathergy 包括血管吻合處周圍的 aneurysms，以及切除受侵腸段後潰瘍局部復發。<span class="ex-ref">p.2573</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="107-40,112-41">陽性 pathergy reaction 是本病的徵象（a sign of Adamantiades–Behçet disease）</mark>，但 <mark data-q="111-34,112-41"><strong>not pathognomonic</strong>：也可見於 pyoderma gangrenosum、rheumatoid arthritis、Crohn disease 與 genital herpes infection</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.2573</span></li>
<li>McKee：<mark data-q="107-40">在 injection sites 等輕微皮膚創傷處出現 sterile pustules（pathergic response）是本病典型而重要的診斷線索</mark>；圖說稱 ruptured pustule at the site of venipuncture 這種 positive provocation test is virtually pathognomonic。有作者發現 4 mm punch biopsy 後傷口癒合與對照組似乎沒有差異。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.744</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Fitzpatrick：positive pathergy reaction is a sign of Adamantiades–Behçet disease, it is not pathognomonic（p.2573）。McKee 圖說：positive provocation test is virtually pathognomonic for Behçet disease（McKee p.744）。Fitzpatrick 列出的其他陽性疾病為 pyoderma gangrenosum、rheumatoid arthritis、Crohn disease、genital herpes infection（p.2573）。</aside>
<h3>McKee 1990 diagnostic criteria（International Study Group）</h3>
