<thead><tr><th scope="col">Criterion</th><th scope="col">Definition</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Recurrent oral ulceration（必要）</td><td>Minor aphthous、major aphthous 或 herpetiform ulceration，由 physician 或 patient 觀察到，且 12 個月內至少復發 <strong class="ex-n">3</strong> 次</td></tr>
<tr><td>Plus two of:</td><td>以下 4 項中符合 2 項</td></tr>
<tr><td>Recurrent genital ulceration</td><td>Aphthous ulceration 或 scarring，由 physician 或 patient 觀察到</td></tr>
<tr><td>Eye lesions</td><td>Anterior uveitis、posterior uveitis，或 slit lamp examination 見 cells in vitreous；或 ophthalmologist 觀察到 retinal vasculitis</td></tr>
