<h3>Radiologic findings（影像）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Scintigraphic evidence of arthritis 見於 <strong class="ex-n">50%</strong> 病人；cranial MRI 可見 hypodense 或 atrophic changes；EEG 偵測到 diffuse α-waves 視為陽性；血管病灶可用 angiography 偵測。<span class="ex-ref">p.2573</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="histo">
<h2>8. Histopathology（病理）</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fitzpatrick：特徵為 <strong>vasculitis and thrombosis</strong>。早期 mucocutaneous lesions 切片見 neutrophilic vascular reaction，伴 endothelial swelling、extravasation of erythrocytes、leukocytoclasia，或發展完全的 leukocytoclastic vasculitis 伴 vessel wall fibrinoid necrosis。<span class="ex-ref">p.2573</span></li>
<li>有些病灶報告以 lymphocytic perivasculitis 為主，但這些多半 likely older；<strong>neutrophilic vascular reaction</strong> 應視為 predominant histopathologic finding。<span class="ex-ref">p.2573</span></li>
<li>Fig. 141-5：口腔潰瘍可見以 neutrophils 為主的豐富 mixed inflammatory infiltrate；erythema nodosum–like lesion 可見 vessel thrombosis。<span class="ex-ref">p.2572</span></li>
<li>McKee：組織學大致 non-specific，診斷 essentially clinical。可見 lymphocytic 與 necrotizing vasculitis 侵犯 superficial postcapillary venules 並有 fibrinoid necrosis；一項研究中近 <strong class="ex-n">50%</strong> 病人有 vasculitis，常 appears to be consequence rather than cause of 皮膚或黏膜炎症；endothelial swelling 可見，常有 lymphocytic perivascular infiltrate，有時 neutrophils 豐富。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.746</span></li>
<li>McKee 一項系列：phlebitis/venulitis <strong class="ex-n">48%</strong>、leukocytoclastic vasculitis <strong class="ex-n">17%</strong>、lymphocytic vasculitis <strong class="ex-n">31%</strong>。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.746</span></li>
<li>McKee：pustular lesions、acute folliculitis、acneiform folliculocentric pustules 對應 diffuse neutrophilic dermal infiltrate（伴或不伴 abscess）；針刺後切片（one study）見 neutrophilic infiltrate with intraepidermal pustules，該研究未見 vasculitis，其他作者發現 pathergic lesions 可有 leukocytoclastic vasculitis 或 Sweet syndrome-like 特徵。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.746</span></li>
<li>McKee：erythema nodosum-like lesions 對應 subcutaneous vessels 的 necrotizing vasculitis，通常伴 thrombosis，也描述過 septal 與 lobular panniculitis；superficial thrombophlebitis 見於最多 <strong class="ex-n">30%</strong> 病人；oral lesions 與 genital ulcers 為 non-specific ulceration，有時伴 leukocytoclastic 或 lymphocytic vasculitis。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.746</span></li>
<li>McKee：肺部為 pulmonary artery vasculitis（thrombosis、infarction、hemorrhage、aneurysm），炎症通常 transmural，可損傷 elastic tissue；腦部病灶早期為 perivenular lymphocytic infiltrate，晚期廣泛 demyelination 類似 multiple sclerosis。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.746</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Fitzpatrick 把 neutrophilic vascular reaction 視為 predominant histopathologic finding，並指出 lymphocytic perivasculitis 為主的病灶 likely older（p.2573）；兩本書都寫沒有 pathognomonic 的 histologic characteristics（Fitzpatrick p.2573；McKee p.747）。</aside>
</section>

