<section class="ex-note" id="prognosis">
<h2>10. Clinical Course &amp; Prognosis（病程與預後）</h2>
<ul>
<li>病程多變；診斷前可延遲長達數年，可能影響預後。Mucocutaneous 與 joint manifestations 通常最先出現。<span class="ex-ref">p.2573</span></li>
<li>Recurrent erythema nodosum 與 HLA-B51 positivity 是 <mark data-q="103-35">superficial thrombophlebitis</mark> 與 vision loss 發生的 risk factors；superficial thrombophlebitis、ocular lesions 與男性是 systemic vessel involvement 的 risk factors。<span class="ex-ref">p.2573–2574</span></li>
<li>嚴重病程（blindness、meningoencephalitis、hemoptysis、intestinal perforation、severe arthritis）約見於 <strong class="ex-n">10%</strong> 病人。Lethal outcome 在不同族群為 <strong class="ex-n">0 to 6%</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.2574</span></li>
<li>主要威脅生命的併發症：CNS、pulmonary、large vessel involvement 與 bowel perforation；死亡也可能來自 immunosuppressive therapy 的併發症。<span class="ex-ref">p.2574</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="115-04">Markers of severe prognosis：HLA-B51 positivity、male gender、early development of systemic signs</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.2574</span></li>
<li>男性與 ocular involvement、vascular involvement、superficial 與 deep venous thrombosis、cardiac involvement、folliculitis、papulopustular lesions 相關；女性較常見 genital ulcers、erythema nodosum 與 joint involvement。<span class="ex-ref">p.2574</span></li>
<li>Onset in childhood does not necessarily predict a poor prognosis；可有部分或全部表現的 spontaneous remissions。Ophthalmic 與 neurologic sequelae 是 morbidity 的主因，其次是嚴重 vascular 與 GI manifestations，其影響可能累積。<span class="ex-ref">p.2574</span></li>
<li>McKee：mortality 很低，約 <strong class="ex-n">2% to 4%</strong>；男性似乎死亡率較高。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.743, 745</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Fitzpatrick 寫 mortality 為 0 to 6%（p.2574），McKee 寫約 2% to 4%（McKee p.745）。Significant neurologic manifestations（顯著神經表現）：Fitzpatrick 約 10%（p.2573），McKee up to 25%（McKee p.745）。</aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="treatment">
<h2>11. Treatment（治療）</h2>
<ul>
<li>治療選擇依 clinical manifestations 的部位與嚴重度。Recurrent aphthae 最常（most often）以 palliative agents 處理：mild diet、避免刺激物、potent topical glucocorticoids、local anesthetics；topical hyaluronic acid <strong class="ex-n">0.2%</strong> gel 每日 2 次、<strong class="ex-n">30 days</strong> 有效。<span class="ex-ref">p.2574</span></li>
<li>Genital ulcers 與皮膚病灶：corticosteroid 與 antiseptic creams 最多使用 <strong class="ex-n">7 days</strong>；疼痛的 genital ulcerations 可用 topical anesthetics cream；頑固病灶可用 corticosteroid injection（triamcinolone acetonide <strong class="ex-n">0.1–0.5 mL/lesion</strong>）。<span class="ex-ref">p.2574</span></li>
<li>Corticosteroid 單次 intravitreal injection（triamcinolone acetonide <strong class="ex-n">4 mg</strong>）對 panuveitis 與 cystoid macular edema 也可有益（can also be beneficial）。<span class="ex-ref">p.2575</span></li>
<li>系統性治療的適應：topical treatment 無效的 mucocutaneous lesions、有 systemic involvement、有 poor prognosis markers 的病人。<span class="ex-ref">p.2575</span></li>
<li>Prednisolone（口服或靜脈）可併用其他 immunosuppressants、colchicine、dapsone、sulfasalazine 或 interferon-α；與 cyclosporine A 併用在 ocular involvement 病人的 synergistic effect 已有描述（has been described）；prednisolone 是少數可在懷孕時使用的藥物。Colchicine 可併用 immunosuppressants 與 interferon-α。停用 cyclosporine A、interferon-α、dapsone 或 infliximab 後常迅速復發。<span class="ex-ref">p.2575</span></li>
<li>Prevention：severe 或 progressive recurrent aphthous stomatitis 病人應追蹤多年，視為潛在 Adamantiades–Behçet disease 候選者（尤其有家族史者）；疑似病例應早期轉介專科；以 systemic involvement 起病的男性和／或早發者，因預後差應給予 systemic treatment。<span class="ex-ref">p.2575</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Topical treatment of oral aphthous ulcers（Table 141-3 摘錄）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Mild diet；避免 hard、spicy、salty 食物及刺激性化學物（如 toasted bread、nuts、oranges、lemons、tomatoes、spices、alcohol- 或 CO2-containing drinks、mouthwashes、含 sodium lauryl sulfate 的牙膏）。</li>
<li>Caustic solutions（silver nitrate 1%–2%、tinctura myrrha 5%–10%、H2O2 0.5%、methyl violet 0.5%）每日 1–2 次。</li>
<li>Corticosteroids（triamcinolone mucosal ointment、dexamethasone mucosal paste、betamethasone pastilles）每日 4 次或夜間；或 triamcinolone suspension 0.1–0.5 mL per lesion 病灶內浸潤。</li>
<li>Anesthetics（lidocaine 2%–5%、mepivacaine 1.5%、tetracaine 0.5%–1%）每日 2–3 次。</li>
<li>5-Aminosalicylic acid（5% cream）每日 3 次（縮短病灶持續時間與疼痛強度）；cyclosporine A 500 mg 溶液漱口每日 3 次；sucralfate suspension 5 mL × 4 次/日（oral aphthous 與 genital ulcers）；tetracycline mouthwash（caveat: pregnancy）。</li>
<li><mark data-q="106-17">A close association of <strong>smoking</strong> with a <strong>decrease of recurrences</strong> of oral aphthous ulcers has been described（抽菸與口腔 aphthous ulcers 復發減少有密切關聯）</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.2574</span></li>
</ul>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 141-3，p.2574。</p>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>原文（Table 141-3，p.2574）：A close association of smoking with a decrease of recurrences of oral aphthous ulcers has been described。</aside>
<h3>Studied systemic treatments（Table 141-4，evidence grade A 摘錄）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Drug</th><th scope="col">Dose</th><th scope="col">Indication</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Methylprednisolone</td><td>40 mg every 3 wk IM</td><td>Erythema nodosum（but not orogenital ulcers）</td></tr>
